{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F9XOgNw6Rv1795771431.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港觀鳥會推算本港市區僅得近21萬隻麻雀，創有紀錄以來新低。</p><p></p><p>香港觀鳥會5月，在全港揀選88條約一公里長的路線，點算路上麻雀數目。推算市區有約20.8萬隻麻雀，按年少逾百分之8，估計因為玻璃幕牆建築增加，減少築巢空間，亦增加雀鳥撞玻璃風險。而極端高溫天氣亦對麻雀生存及繁殖造成熱壓力等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BIRD-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OnNKweqYix1795771544.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，觀鳥會首次把喜鵲納入「高本地滅絕風險」，建議政府在未來城市規劃，增加生態友善綠化空間，在市區設置雀鳥巢箱等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BIRD-1600_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XQqnv7cOaw1795771559.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.728660+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T21:57:31.684415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:15.849616+00:00","content_hash":"fc7d139d8fdd6ac93da8039b3f5c411cd04551d005e0786ff1ab1716818c8694","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.728660+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}